Завял венок; наутро надо новый
Сплести себе из тонких гибких веток;

translation:
A couple so wondrous is hard to find!
The wreath has wilted; by morning I need a new one
To weave for myself from thin, flexible branches;

What longing makes my soul sick. It knew not
Until now the sufferings of love;
